sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant B as gRPC Broker
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant I as Inventory
    participant A as Audit

    P->>B: CreateTopic(orders.v1) [unary]
    P->>B: Publish(message) [unary]
    B->>DB: persist message + deliveries/consumer
    DB-->>B: commit
    B-->>P: PublishReply accepted=true
    Note over P,B: confirmarea inseamna persistat la broker, nu procesat de consumatori

    I->>B: Subscribe(inventory, orders.v1) [server stream]
    A->>B: Subscribe(audit, orders.v1) [server stream]
    B-->>I: Delivery attempt=1
    B-->>A: Delivery attempt=1
    I->>B: ACK RECEIVED
    I->>I: effect + dedup in tranzactie locala
    I->>B: ACK PROCESSED
    I->>B: ACK PERSISTED (final)
    A->>B: ACK RECEIVED -> PROCESSED -> PERSISTED
